                  <t:label>16th story on lake ʾAbāwi</t:label>
                  <t:ab>ዘባሕረ፡ አባዊ፡</t:ab>
                  <t:div type="textpart" subtype="explicit" xml:lang="gez">
                     <t:note>The following explicit is taken from <t:ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/BAVet119">Vatican City, Biblioteca Apostolica Vaticana, Aeth.119</t:ref> according to
                        <t:bibl corresp="http://zotero.org/groups/358366/items/QZH8VYBF"><seg type="book"><!-- attributes from original bibl--></seg><ptr target="bm:GrebTiss1935Codices"/><title level="m">Bybliothecae apostolicae Vaticanae codices manu scripti recensiti iussu Pii XI Pontificis maximi. Codices Aethiopici Vaticani et Borgiani, Barberinianus orientalis 2, Rossianus 865&lt;hi rend="italics"&gt;, I:&lt;/hi&gt; Enarratio codicum</title><author><forename>Sylvain</forename><surname>Grébaut</surname></author><author><forename>Eugène</forename><surname>Tisserant</surname></author><pubPlace>Città del Vaticano</pubPlace><publisher>In Bybliotheca Vaticana</publisher><date>1935</date><note type="tags"><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">bm:GrebTiss1935Codices</note></note><note type="tag">Cataloguing</note><note type="tag">Ethiopic</note><note type="tag">bm:GrebTiss1935Codices</note><t:citedRange unit="page">480</t:citedRange></t:bibl>.</t:note>
                     <t:ab>
                        ፲፮ ሐቲ<t:supplied reason="omitted">ት፡</t:supplied> በተዋስቦ፡ እመሰ፡ ትፈቅድ፡ ተዋስቦ፡ ተዓገሥ፡ እስመ፡ <t:sic>በተዓገሦ፡</t:sic> ይትረከብ፡
                        በ<t:del rend="expunctuated">ብ</t:del>ትፍሥሕት፡ <t:sic>ወኃሢት፤</t:sic> ወብዕል፡ ወኵሉ፡ <t:sic>ተምኒትከ፡</t:sic> ወአንተ፡ <t:sic>ኵን፡</t:sic> ኅዱዓ፡
                        በኵሉ፡ <t:choice><t:sic>ነገር፡</t:sic><t:corr resp="PRS4805Grebaut PRS9530Tisseran">ነገረ፡</t:corr></t:choice> ተዋስቦ፡ ወዝኒ፡ ተዋስቦ፡ ዘትሄሊ፡ ይከውኖሙ፡
                        ለእሉ፡ ትፍሥሕት፡ <t:sic>ወኃሢት፡</t:sic> ወብዕል፨
                     </t:ab>
